t with the reference skirt height.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "Catkins, fruiting structures, lenticel banding, peeling strips and diamond fissures are not resolvable in reference-0; the render likewise shows no separable reproductive or lenticel detail at this scale.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "impact": "required_unknown", "uncertain": true, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "Render finish is at or above the anchor floor: clean silhouette, no stray or floating geometry, coherent single cast shadow, consistent sky and ground treatment.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "anchor-0"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}], "coverage": [{"trait_id": "habit.crown.pendulous-branchlets", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Core. Continuous curtain-like near-vertical strands hang from arching laterals across the render crown from upper crown to roughly mid-trunk and dominate the outer silhouette, matching the reference character."}, {"trait_id": "habit.crown.open-airy-texture", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Core. Sky shows through the render crown interior and between strands; foliage sits as small discrete clusters along drooping shoots, not as a solid dense mass."}, {"trait_id": "bark.trunk.pale-white-upper", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Core. Render trunk and larger ascending limbs are distinctly pale over mid and upper sections. Tone is cooler bluish-grey than the reference's sunlit white; that is a finish nuance within acceptable variation, not a defining mismatch."}, {"trait_id": "bark.trunk.dark-rough-base", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Core. A markedly darker, coarser butt occupies approximately the lowest fifth of